Third-party material. The repository holds no lidar data; the map loads shaded relief live from each publisher.
The images in img/, header.png, release/ and reddit/ contain shaded relief from these publishers, under their licences:
Environment Agency (Open Government Licence v3); IGN France (Licence Ouverte 2.0); Digitaal Vlaanderen (free reuse licence);
AHN via PDOK (CC0); swisstopo (free use with credit); Kartverket (CC BY 4.0); USGS 3DEP (public domain); GSI Japan (GSI terms,
with credit); IGN Spain (CC BY 4.0); basemap.at (CC BY 4.0); CUZK (CC BY 4.0); Bayerische Vermessungsverwaltung (CC BY 4.0);
Geobasis NRW (dl-de/zero-2-0); GURS Slovenia (CC BY 4.0); Luxembourg ACT (CC0); and Esri World Hillshade.
Coverage outlines: Natural Earth (public domain).
